			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Light's Hope Chapel stands on a green rise in the far east of the Plaguelands, the one piece of clean ground for many miles. It is the home of the {link:argent-dawn}Argent Dawn{/link}. Around the old chapel, the Dawn has raised tents, forges and stables, and its sentries watch the roads day and night. {link:lord-maxwell-tyrosus}Lord Maxwell Tyrosus{/link} keeps his council inside the chapel. {link:duke-nicholas-zverenhoff}Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff{/link}, {link:carlin-redpath}Carlin Redpath{/link}, the undead knight {link:leonid-barthalomew}Leonid Barthalomew{/link} and the alchemist {link:betina-bigglezink}Betina Bigglezink{/link} work beneath its walls. Travellers of every race come here, for the Dawn does not ask who its allies were before. Below the rise lies a pit where the Dawn lays its dead, and even these are not safe from thieves.]=],
